WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
In the fantasy world, we have reached a contract

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,500
If you hurt your master, you will suffer backlash

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:09,360
The superpowers of the new players in the next clear team are so useful.

4
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,860
Peeping into innermost secrets and creating illusions

5
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:14,860
Luring the opponent to sign a soul contract is not bloody.

6
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:19,050
Fantasyland?Contract?

7
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,550
It turns out it was all an illusion just now

8
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,050
But the contract is real

9
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:24,050
I was tricked from the moment I entered the area.

10
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,050
Then all the secrets in my fantasy were captured by it...

11
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:34,670
I know what you are thinking

12
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,670
I have complete control over your soul

13
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:38,830
I hope you will work harder for your stronghold

14
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,830
I can make you immortal

15
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:43,120
Shen Cuirong
